#Organize Import Order
#LINSTOR canonical import order - see docs/import-order.md
#Import in Eclipse via: Preferences > Java > Code Style > Organize Imports > Import...
#  0  com.linbit.**  (own code)
#  1  javax.**
#  2  java.**
#  3  all other (3rd-party) imports   -> empty value = catch-all bucket
#  4  all static imports              -> \# = static catch-all, sorted last
0=com.linbit
1=javax
2=java
3=
4=\#
